<div id="inline-notice">
  <section-header/>

  <p>
    An inline notice may optionally show a status icon. Add the
    <code>inline-notice--confirmation</code>, <code>
      inline-notice--attention
    </code>, <code>inline-notice--information</code>, or <code>
      inline-notice--warning
    </code> modifier to the inline notice to apply the corresponding status
    color to its icon.
  </p>

